From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lalit Maganti <lalitmaganti@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: nopr: flamegraph hide metric selector

Thread a hideMetricSelector option through Flamegraph / QueryFlamegraph /
FlamegraphPanel so an embedder that drives the selected metric itself (e.g.
via its own tabs) can suppress the in-bar metric picker. Sismo-local; no
upstream PR yet.
---
 ui/src/components/flamegraph_panel.ts |  4 +++
 ui/src/components/query_flamegraph.ts |  6 ++++-
 ui/src/widgets/flamegraph.ts          | 39 ++++++++++++++++-----------
 3 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

